@startuml
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName Helvetica
participant Host
participant "Rust VM\n(context ABI)" as VM
Host -> VM : gf_activate_context(GFCA1)
note right of VM : bindings validated;\nterminal capacity 1-4096
opt only before the first scan
  Host -> VM : gf_restore_context_checkpoint(GFCX3)
end
loop every scan
  Host -> VM : gf_tick_context(GFSF4/5/6 facts)
  VM --> Host : outcome and trace (committed only on success)
end
Host -> VM : gf_context_checkpoint
VM --> Host : bytes + effective settings JSON\n(via ptr/len accessors)
note left of Host : host owns durable storage\nand acknowledgement
@enduml
